  "gizmo|scientists look very closely. let's spot what makes each shark special!": "audio/voice/gizmo/31deb9e637.mp3",
  "gizmo|which shark has a wide, hammer-shaped head?": "audio/voice/gizmo/66e7d92c6e.mp3",
  "gizmo|the hammerhead! its wide head has special sensors that help it find food.": "audio/voice/gizmo/1fd995b3ca.mp3",
  "gizmo|which shark has pale spots all over its back?": "audio/voice/gizmo/b116ba6fd4.mp3",
  "gizmo|the whale shark! it is the biggest fish in the sea.": "audio/voice/gizmo/2573433a9a.mp3",
  "gizmo|which shark has a long, flat snout?": "audio/voice/gizmo/76c8547b52.mp3",
  "gizmo|the goblin shark! its flat snout helps it search for food in the deep.": "audio/voice/gizmo/c268ff59e4.mp3",
  "gizmo|which shark has a big dark spot behind its fin?": "audio/voice/gizmo/e2b35cd831.mp3",
  "gizmo|the epaulette shark! that dark spot helps us recognise it.": "audio/voice/gizmo/509621654f.mp3",
  "gizmo|which shark has a pointed nose and a strong tail for speed?": "audio/voice/gizmo/53d9a0844d.mp3",
  "gizmo|the mako! its pointed nose and strong tail help it swim fast, like dash.": "audio/voice/gizmo/b12cf5e74f.mp3",
  "gizmo|fish have fins and breathe with gills. let's sort the sea animals!": "audio/voice/gizmo/bd0cc1a424.mp3",
  "gizmo|a tuna. is it a fish?": "audio/voice/gizmo/7c4e75909d.mp3",
  "gizmo|yes! a tuna has fins and breathes with gills.": "audio/voice/gizmo/6074a94c47.mp3",
  "gizmo|fish, or not a fish?": "audio/voice/gizmo/394a4200df.mp3",
  "gizmo|a crab. is it a fish?": "audio/voice/gizmo/21a553c30d.mp3",
  "gizmo|not a fish! a crab has legs and a hard shell, and no fins.": "audio/voice/gizmo/1f74889975.mp3",
  "gizmo|a whale shark. is it a fish?": "audio/voice/gizmo/60cc1c990a.mp3",
  "gizmo|yes! a whale shark is a fish, even with whale in its name. it breathes with gills.": "audio/voice/gizmo/f427513276.mp3",
  "gizmo|a sea turtle. is it a fish?": "audio/voice/gizmo/c9a1a25b45.mp3",
  "gizmo|not a fish! sea turtles breathe air with lungs. they are reptiles.": "audio/voice/gizmo/391a4bc0a4.mp3",
  "gizmo|a clownfish. is it a fish?": "audio/voice/gizmo/711e7b0af1.mp3",
  "gizmo|yes! a clownfish has fins and gills.": "audio/voice/gizmo/663fbc9248.mp3",
  "gizmo|a dolphin. is it a fish?": "audio/voice/gizmo/58c82caa49.mp3",
  "gizmo|not a fish! dolphins breathe air, like us. they are mammals.": "audio/voice/gizmo/f8be58470e.mp3",
  "gizmo|scientists guess first, then test. will it sink or float? make your guess!": "audio/voice/gizmo/77bb18075b.mp3",
  "gizmo|sharks don't sink to the bottom when they swim. most sharks have a big, oily liver that helps them stay up in the water.": "audio/voice/gizmo/e19be7d9af.mp3",
  "gizmo|a rock. will it sink or float?": "audio/voice/gizmo/357d924aa1.mp3",
  "gizmo|it sank! a rock is heavy for its size.": "audio/voice/gizmo/d771c85560.mp3",
  "gizmo|sink, or float?": "audio/voice/gizmo/b307c62231.mp3",
  "gizmo|a toy duck. will it sink or float?": "audio/voice/gizmo/921268a303.mp3",
  "gizmo|it floats! the plastic duck is full of air.": "audio/voice/gizmo/eead26ddb6.mp3",
  "gizmo|a metal spoon. will it sink or float?": "audio/voice/gizmo/5339e97dc4.mp3",
  "gizmo|it sank! this spoon is made of metal.": "audio/voice/gizmo/6b0c166e33.mp3",
  "gizmo|a little wooden boat. will it sink or float?": "audio/voice/gizmo/28aac629e5.mp3",
  "gizmo|it floats! wood floats, and the boat's shape helps too.": "audio/voice/gizmo/93b460128c.mp3",
  "gizmo|a sea shell. will it sink or float?": "audio/voice/gizmo/01327a634e.mp3",
  "gizmo|it sank to the bottom, where shells are found on the sea floor.": "audio/voice/gizmo/063e3d8f25.mp3",
  "gizmo|sea animals move in different ways. how does each one move?": "audio/voice/gizmo/5519a2ac3d.mp3",
  "gizmo|how does a great white shark swim?": "audio/voice/gizmo/2513f55330.mp3",
  "gizmo|it swishes its tail from side to side. its fins help it steer.": "audio/voice/gizmo/7922821e45.mp3",
  "gizmo|swishes its tail, or walks, or squirts water?": "audio/voice/gizmo/0db27f88b5.mp3",
  "gizmo|how does a crab move?": "audio/voice/gizmo/c16cec4d7f.mp3",
  "gizmo|a crab walks on its legs, often sideways!": "audio/voice/gizmo/948a129f2b.mp3",
  "gizmo|squirts water, or walks, or swishes its tail?": "audio/voice/gizmo/aa4b03f332.mp3",
  "gizmo|how does a squid zoom away?": "audio/voice/gizmo/fd005d7a4b.mp3",
  "gizmo|a squid squirts water out to shoot away, like a little rocket.": "audio/voice/gizmo/27a2dbde21.mp3",
  "gizmo|walks, or swishes its tail, or squirts water?": "audio/voice/gizmo/18c3f1dd5e.mp3",
  "gizmo|an epaulette shark. how does it get around the reef floor?": "audio/voice/gizmo/c6e0f46c56.mp3",
  "gizmo|it walks! it bends its body and uses its fins to clamber along the bottom.": "audio/voice/gizmo/6fa56ddd95.mp3",
  "gizmo|squirts water, or walks, or flaps flippers?": "audio/voice/gizmo/59e0cb1b0a.mp3",
  "gizmo|how does a sea turtle swim?": "audio/voice/gizmo/ba9ed25d94.mp3",
  "gizmo|it flaps its big flippers, like wings under the water.": "audio/voice/gizmo/bbc8ee9584.mp3",
  "gizmo|flaps flippers, or squirts water, or walks?": "audio/voice/gizmo/9d5dab29b9.mp3",
