  "gizmo|a great white shark.": "audio/voice/gizmo/c527dc2ba5.mp3",
  "gizmo|real today! great whites live in seas around australia.": "audio/voice/gizmo/4aeea6fa37.mp3",
  "gizmo|look closely at each photo. find the shark with that special feature.": "audio/voice/gizmo/a81ce4189b.mp3",
  "gizmo|does it have fins and breathe with gills under water? then it is a fish.": "audio/voice/gizmo/f77d9fcb12.mp3",
